<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>第10课 · 异常处理 —— 防崩护盾</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#0d1021; --bg2:#141833; --card:#1a1f3d;
    --gold:#f5c542; --cyan:#4dd6ff; --purple:#a78bfa;
    --green:#4dd6ff; --pink:#f472b6; --orange:#fb923c;
    --red:#f87171; --text:#e8eaf6; --muted:#8b93b8; --line:#2a3060;
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{
    font-family:"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;
    background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);line-height:1.75;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 40% at 50% -10%, rgba(77,214,255,.10), transparent),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 40% 30% at 95% 90%, rgba(167,139,250,.08), transparent);
  }
  .wrap{max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;padding:36px 20px 80px;}
  /* 头部 */
  .crumb{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:14px;}
  .crumb b{color:var(--cyan);}
  header{text-align:center;margin-bottom:34px;}
  .lesson-badge{
    display:inline-block;padding:4px 16px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;
    background:rgba(77,214,255,.12);color:var(--cyan);border:1px solid rgba(77,214,255,.35);margin-bottom:12px;
  }
  h1{
    font-size:32px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1px;
    background:linear-gradient(120deg,#4dd6ff,#a78bfa 50%,#f5c542);
    -webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;
  }
  .subtitle{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px;font-size:14px;}
  .mission{
    margin-top:18px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;
    padding:16px 22px;text-align:left;font-size:14px;
  }
  .mission h3{color:var(--gold);font-size:15px;margin-bottom:6px;}
  .mission li{margin-left:18px;}
  /* 板块 */
  section{
    background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;
    padding:26px 28px;margin-bottom:26px;animation:fadeUp .6s ease both;
  }
  section:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.05s;}
  section h2{
    font-size:19px;margin-bottom:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;letter-spacing:1px;
  }
  .num{
    width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:9px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--cyan),var(--purple));
    color:#0d1021;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    font-size:15px;font-weight:800;flex-shrink:0;
  }
  section p{margin-bottom:10px;}
  .hl{color:var(--gold);font-weight:600;}
  .hl-c{color:var(--cyan);font-weight:600;}
  /* 代码块 */
  .code{
    background:#0a0d1e;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;
    padding:16px 18px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;
    font-size:14px;overflow-x:auto;margin:12px 0;position:relative;white-space:pre-wrap;
  }
  .code .c{color:#5b648f;}   /* 注释 */
  .code .k{color:var(--pink);} /* 关键字/函数 */
  .code .s{color:#8be9fd;} /* 字符串 */
  .code .n{color:var(--orange);} /* 数字 */
  .code .v{color:var(--cyan);}  /* 变量 */
  .out{
    background:#0a0d1e;border:1px dashed var(--line);border-radius:12px;
    padding:12px 18px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:14px;
    color:#a9ecff;margin-top:-4px;margin-bottom:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;
  }
  .out::before{content:"▶ 输出：";color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;display:block;margin-bottom:2px;}
  /* 魔法盒子动画 */
  .boxes{display:flex;gap:16px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:20px 0;}
  .mbox{
    width:150px;background:var(--card);border:2px solid var(--cyan);border-radius:14px;
    padding:14px;text-align:center;position:relative;transition:all .3s;cursor:default;
  }
  .mbox:hover{transform:translateY(-6px) scale(1.04);box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(77,214,255,.25);}
  .mbox .tag{
    font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--cyan);
    background:rgba(77,214,255,.1);border-radius:8px;padding:2px 8px;display:inline-block;
    word-break:break-all;
  }
  .mbox .val{
    font-size:19px;font-weight:800;margin:8px 0 4px;color:var(--gold);word-break:break-all;
  }
  .mbox .tip{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);}
  .mbox.danger{border-color:var(--red);}
  .mbox.danger .tag{color:var(--red);background:rgba(248,113,113,.1);}
  /* 流程图 */
  .flow{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:10px 0;font-size:13px;}
  .fnode{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--cyan);border-radius:10px;padding:7px 13px;}
  .fnode.bad{border-color:var(--red);}
  .fnode.auto{border-color:var(--gold);}
  .farrow{color:var(--muted);}
  .flow-label{font-size:12px;color:var(--cyan);margin-top:8px;font-weight:600;}
  /* 守则框 */
  .rule-box{border-radius:12px;padding:14px 18px;margin:12px 0;font-size:14px;}
  .rule-ok{background:rgba(77,214,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(77,214,255,.4);}
  .rule-no{background:rgba(248,113,113,.08);border:1px solid rgba(248,113,113,.4);}
  .rule-box b{font-size:15px;}
  .rule-ok b{color:var(--cyan);}
  .rule-no b{color:var(--red);}
  /* 实验室 */
  .lab-input{
    display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:14px 0;align-items:center;
  }
  .lab-input input{
    flex:1;min-width:180px;background:#0a0d1e;border:1px solid var(--cyan);border-radius:10px;
    padding:11px 16px;color:var(--text);font-size:15px;outline:none;
  }
  .lab-input input:focus{box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(77,214,255,.18);}
  .btn{
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--cyan),var(--purple));color:#0d1021;border:none;
    padding:11px 22px;border-radius:10px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;
    transition:transform .15s, box-shadow .2s;font-family:inherit;
  }
  .btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(77,214,255,.3);}
  .chaos-tip{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);margin:4px 0 8px;}
  .chaos-row{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:6px;}
  .cbtn{
    background:#1a1f3d;border:1px solid var(--orange);color:var(--orange);
    padding:8px 14px;border-radius:9px;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;transition:all .2s;
  }
  .cbtn:hover{background:rgba(251,146,60,.15);transform:translateY(-2px);}
  .lab-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;margin-top:14px;}
  @media(max-width:720px){.lab-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .panel{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 16px;}
  .panel-title{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;letter-spacing:1px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;}
  .panel-title.danger{color:var(--red);}
  .panel-title.shield{color:var(--cyan);}
  .run-box{
    background:#0a0d1e;border:1px dashed var(--line);border-radius:10px;
    padding:10px 14px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px;
    color:#a9ecff;margin-top:8px;min-height:56px;white-space:pre-wrap;
  }
  .run-box::before{content:"▶ 运行结果：";color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;display:block;margin-bottom:4px;}
  .run-box.crash{border-color:var(--red);color:var(--red);animation:shake .4s;}
  .run-box.safe{border-color:var(--cyan);}
  .run-box .c{color:#5b648f;}
  .lab-tip{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:10px 0 0;}
  /* 预言机 */
  .oracle-q{
    background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;
    padding:16px 20px;margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  .oracle-q .qtitle{font-size:14px;color:var(--purple);margin-bottom:8px;font-weight:600;}
  .oracle-opts{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px;}
  .opt{
    background:#0a0d1e;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;color:var(--text);
    padding:8px 16px;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;
    transition:all .2s;
  }
  .opt:hover{border-color:var(--cyan);}
  .opt.right{border-color:var(--green);background:rgba(77,214,255,.15);color:var(--cyan);}
  .opt.wrong{border-color:var(--red);background:rgba(248,113,113,.12);color:var(--red);}
  .explain{
    display:none;margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);
    border-left:3px solid var(--gold);padding-left:12px;
  }
  .explain.show{display:block;animation:fadeIn .4s;}
  /* 记忆卡片 */
  .cards-grid{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:16px;
  }
  .mcard{
    perspective:800px;height:130px;cursor:pointer;
  }
  .mcard-inner{
    position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;transition:transform .55s;
    transform-style:preserve-3d;
  }
  .mcard.flip .mcard-inner{transform:rotateY(180deg);}
  .mface{
    position:absolute;inset:0;backface-visibility:hidden;border-radius:13px;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;
    padding:12px;font-size:14px;
  }
  .mfront{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1d2448,#141833);border:1px solid var(--cyan);color:var(--cyan);font-weight:600;}
  .mback{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#16284a,#101530);border:1px solid var(--gold);color:var(--text);transform:rotateY(180deg);font-size:13px;}
  .cards-tip{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px;}
  /* Quiz */
  .quiz-q{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;margin-bottom:14px;}
  .quiz-q .qq{font-size:15px;margin-bottom:10px;font-weight:600;}
  .quiz-q .qq i{color:var(--gold);font-style:normal;margin-right:6px;}
  .qq-opts{display:grid;gap:8px;}
  .qq-opt{
    background:#0a0d1e;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;color:var(--text);
    padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;transition:all .2s;font-family:inherit;
  }
  .qq-opt:hover{border-color:var(--cyan);}
  .qq-opt.right{border-color:var(--green);background:rgba(77,214,255,.15);}
  .qq-opt.wrong{border-color:var(--red);background:rgba(248,113,113,.12);}
  .qq-exp{display:none;margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);border-left:3px solid var(--gold);padding-left:12px;}
  .qq-exp.show{display:block;}
  #quiz-result{
    display:none;margin-top:16px;text-align:center;padding:18px;border-radius:14px;
    background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--gold);animation:popIn .4s both;
  }
  #quiz-result.show{display:block;}
  #quiz-result b{font-size:34px;color:var(--gold);display:block;}
  /* 课后任务 */
  .homework li{margin:8px 0 8px 18px;}
  .homework code{background:rgba(77,214,255,.1);color:var(--cyan);padding:1px 7px;border-radius:6px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px;}
  footer{text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:40px;padding-top:24px;border-top:1px dashed var(--line);}
  @keyframes fadeUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px);}to{opacity:1;transform:none;}}
  @keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0;}to{opacity:1;}}
  @keyframes popIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale(.7);}to{opacity:1;transform:scale(1);}}
  @keyframes shake{0%,100%{transform:translateX(0);}20%{transform:translateX(-6px);}40%{transform:translateX(6px);}60%{transform:translateX(-4px);}80%{transform:translateX(4px);}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  <div class="crumb">◈ 装备库 · <b>第 10 课 / 共 26 课</b></div>

  <header>
    <div class="lesson-badge">STAGE 2 · ARMORY</div>
    <h1>异常处理 —— 防崩护盾</h1>
    <div class="subtitle">今日目标：让程序被用户捣乱也不崩溃</div>
    <div class="mission">
      <h3>📜 今日任务清单</h3>
      <li>学会<span class="hl">从下往上</span>看懂报错信息（错误类型 + 行号）</li>
      <li>掌握 <span class="hl">try / except</span> 防崩护盾的基本结构</li>
      <li>认领五大通缉犯：ValueError / ZeroDivisionError / KeyError / IndexError / TypeError</li>
      <li>学会多 except 分支、<span class="hl">else / finally</span>、except ... as e</li>
      <li>分清「该防护的用户输入」和「该修掉的逻辑 bug」</li>
      <li>通关实验室「打不死的年龄计算器」+ 预言机 5 连 + Quiz ≥ 80 分</li>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- 1 看懂报错 -->
  <section>
    <h2><span class="num">1</span>崩溃现场调查：从下往上看报错</h2>
    <p>程序崩溃时 Python 会甩出一大坨红色文字（Traceback），新手第一反应是「完蛋了」。错！<span class="hl">报错不是审判书，是藏宝图</span>——它把出错的位置和原因全告诉你了。</p>
    <p>正确的阅读姿势是<span class="hl">从下往上</span>看：</p>
    <div class="code"><span class="c">Traceback (most recent call last):          # ④ 报错回溯开始了</span>
  File <span class="s">"shop.py"</span>, line <span class="n">3</span>, in &lt;module&gt;   <span class="c"># ③ 出错地点：哪个文件第几行</span>
    price = <span class="k">int</span>(<span class="s">"abc"</span>)                    <span class="c"># ② 出错的那一行代码</span>
<span class="k">ValueError</span>: invalid literal for int() with base 10: 'abc'  <span class="c"># ① 先看这里！错误类型 + 原因</span></div>

    <div class="boxes">
      <div class="mbox"><div class="tag">第 ① 步</div><div class="val">错误类型</div><div class="tip">最后一行开头，如 ValueError</div></div>
      <div class="mbox"><div class="tag">第 ② 步</div><div class="val">定位行号</div><div class="tip">往上找 line 3，锁定现场</div></div>
      <div class="mbox"><div class="tag">第 ③ 步</div><div class="val">读原因</div><div class="tip">invalid literal = 转不了这个值</div></div>
    </div>
    <p>翻译成人话：shop.py 第 3 行，<code class="hl-c">int("abc")</code> 试图把 "abc" 转成整数，失败，抛出 <span class="hl">ValueError</span>。看懂了报错，bug 就修好了一半。</p>
  </section>

  <!-- 2 try/except -->
  <section>
    <h2><span class="num">2</span>try / except：给代码穿上护盾</h2>
    <p>用户是不受控的：你让他输数字，他偏输「abc」；你做除法，他偏填 0。程序一崩，游戏进度、聊天记录全没了。<span class="hl">try/except</span> 就是防崩护盾：</p>
    <div class="code"><span class="k">try</span>:
    <span class="v">age</span> = <span class="k">int</span>(<span class="k">input</span>(<span class="s">"年龄："</span>))     <span class="c"># 把可能有危险的代码放进 try</span>
    <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">"明年你"</span>, <span class="v">age</span> + <span class="n">1</span>, <span class="s">"岁"</span>)
<span class="k">except</span>:
    <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">"这输入我看不懂……"</span>)  <span class="c"># 真出错了，就执行这里的补救</span>
<span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">"程序还活着！"</span>)          <span class="c"># 捕获后程序继续往下跑</span></div>
    <p>用户输入 abc 时：</p>
    <div class="out">这输入我看不懂……
程序还活着！</div>

    <p>两条执行路线记牢（鼠标移上去看看）：</p>
    <div class="flow-label">💥 路线一：try 里出错了</div>
    <div class="flow">
      <div class="fnode bad">try 里的代码 💥 出错</div><span class="farrow">→</span>
      <div class="fnode">立刻跳到 except 执行补救</div><span class="farrow">→</span>
      <div class="fnode auto">继续跑后面的代码 ✅</div>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-label">✅ 路线二：try 里没出错</div>
    <div class="flow">
      <div class="fnode">try 里的代码正常跑完</div><span class="farrow">→</span>
      <div class="fnode">整个 except 被跳过</div><span class="farrow">→</span>
      <div class="fnode auto">继续跑后面的代码 ✅</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3 五大异常 -->
  <section>
    <h2><span class="num">3</span>五大通缉犯：捕获指定异常</h2>
    <p>裸写 except 会把<b>所有</b>错误都吞掉——包括你没想到的 bug，这很危险。职业做法是<span class="hl">点名捕获</span>。先认识五个最常见的通缉犯：</p>
    <div class="boxes">
      <div class="mbox danger"><div class="tag">ValueError</div><div class="val">int("abc")</div><div class="tip">值转换失败</div></div>
      <div class="mbox danger"><div class="tag">ZeroDivisionError</div><div class="val">10 / 0</div><div class="tip">除数为零</div></div>
      <div class="mbox danger"><div class="tag">IndexError</div><div class="val">[1,2,3][5]</div><div class="tip">下标越界</div></div>
      <div class="mbox danger"><div class="tag">KeyError</div><div class="val">hero["mp"]</div><div class="tip">字典没这个键</div></div>
      <div class="mbox danger"><div class="tag">TypeError</div><div class="val">"a" + 1</div><div class="tip">类型不兼容</div></div>
    </div>

    <p>一个 try 后面可以跟<span class="hl">多个 except 分支</span>，Python 从上到下找第一个匹配的：</p>
    <div class="code"><span class="k">try</span>:
    <span class="v">nums</span> = [<span class="n">1</span>, <span class="n">2</span>, <span class="n">3</span>]
    <span class="v">i</span> = <span class="k">int</span>(<span class="k">input</span>(<span class="s">"输入下标："</span>))
    <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="v">nums</span>[<span class="v">i</span>])
<span class="k">except</span> <span class="k">ValueError</span>:
    <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">"下标必须是整数！"</span>)
<span class="k">except</span> <span class="k">IndexError</span>:
    <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">"下标越界了，列表只有 3 个元素"</span>)
<span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">"程序还活着"</span>)</div>
    <p>输入 abc → 「下标必须是整数！」；输入 5 → 「下标越界了……」。两种意外各有各的处理，<span class="hl">互不干扰，程序都不崩</span>。</p>
  </section>

  <!-- 4 else finally -->
  <section>
    <h2><span class="num">4</span>else、finally 与 as e：护盾完全体</h2>
    <p>护盾还有两个高级部件：<span class="hl-c">else</span>（没出错才执行）和 <span class="hl-c">finally</span>（无论如何都执行，适合收尾，比如关文件）：</p>
    <div class="code"><span class="k">try</span>:
    <span class="v">n</span> = <span class="k">int</span>(<span class="k">input</span>(<span class="s">"输入一个数字："</span>))   <span class="c"># 假设输入 8</span>
<span class="k">except</span> <span class="k">ValueError</span> <span class="k">as</span> <span class="v">e</span>:
    <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">"出错了："</span>, <span class="v">e</span>)
<span class="k">else</span>:
    <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">"输入合法："</span>, <span class="v">n</span>)      <span class="c"># 只有 try 没出错才执行</span>
<span class="k">finally</span>:
    <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="s">"收工！"</span>)             <span class="c"># 无论出不出错都执行</span></div>
    <div class="out">输入合法： 8
收工！</div>
    <p>如果输入的是 abc，就会走 except 分支，输出「出错了： invalid literal for int() with base 10: 'abc'」——<span class="hl-c">as e</span> 把错误信息装进变量 e，打印出来方便排查，最后照样打印「收工！」。</p>

    <p>最重要的一课：<span class="hl">护盾不是万能药</span>，分清两种错误：</p>
